-- Phase A re-seed: replaces the old 88-spot public.spots table with the
-- new 176-spot Master Consolidated dataset (177 filtered, minus 1 merge).
-- MUST be run whenever FALLBACK_SPOTS' id scheme changes — spot_reports.spot_id
-- has a foreign-key constraint against this table; a mismatch means every
-- report silently fails its FK check (surfaced now, since Phase 0, but still
-- breaks reporting entirely until this is run).
--
-- Old ids (1-88) are being replaced wholesale, not preserved. This orphans
-- pre-existing spot_reports rows (harmless — all are Claude's own test data
-- from earlier verification passes, zero real users yet).

